Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how much longer we'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.38,0:00:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.93,0:00:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't go back to Highland anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.55,0:00:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's take our time and \Nfigure out our next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.39,0:00:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's great having you guys around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.06,0:00:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been so good to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.98,0:00:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the least we could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.86,0:00:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. We'll help you with anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.95,0:00:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to see Viktor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.88,0:00:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}In hindsight, "What lies ahead of us?"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.89,0:00:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}was just a luxury{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.27,0:01:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Driven by necessity, we run forth,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.11,0:01:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}robbed even of the choice to turn back{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.61,0:01:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I long for the one I await{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.82,0:01:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}under the pale moon{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.37,0:01:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}shining on my weak self{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.20,0:01:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}and on this curse, all the same{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.79,0:01:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Though the winds cross the distant skies{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}and countless stars call on you{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.84,0:01:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Even sorrow has mellowed,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.05,0:01:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}making it hard to cry{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.93,0:01:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}While there's only one beginning,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.02,0:01:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}the end point is not set in stone{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.81,0:01:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Never trust in fate{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.15,0:01:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}The hero you'll become was once afraid{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:10.34,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}MERCENARY FORTRESS
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.42,0:02:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey, Apple!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.71,0:02:13.22,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}EPISODE 2: MAD PRINCE LUCA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.30,0:02:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You haven't changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.34,0:02:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a disciple of the \Nfamous strategist,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.30,0:02:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mathiu Silverberg, and an old comrade \Nwho fought alongside Viktor and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.14,0:02:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'm sure you didn't \Ncome here just to say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.52,0:02:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.23,0:02:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The Highland Army, led by Luca Blight, \Nis advancing on the City-States.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the ceasefire?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.74,0:02:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Luca says we broke the agreement first
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,by attacking the Youth Brigade,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.71,0:02:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so the advance is in retaliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, they aren't going straight to Muse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.29,0:02:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This fortress, east of Muse, \Nleaves their rear exposed,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,making it an immediate target.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.59,0:03:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So this place is about \Nto become a battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.10,0:03:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.10,0:03:04.27,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}TOTO VILLAGE
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.35,0:03:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Lord Luca, it's time to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.23,0:03:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.15,0:03:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The kids who escaped \Nwere from the village?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.07,0:03:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're currently looking \Ninto their whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.70,0:03:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.16,0:03:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.17,0:03:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The Flame Spear was created \Nfrom a dwarfish relic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a larger version,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.88,0:03:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the Dragon Flame Spear, \Ndesigned for long-range fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.60,0:03:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You can load three spears that \Ncan be launched over the forest
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.27,0:03:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and strike the ground beyond,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.06,0:03:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,creating a wall of fire to \Nhalt the enemy's advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.44,0:03:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.40,0:03:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But kinda worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.99,0:03:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The spears are rusty, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.03,0:04:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dragon Spear was just \Nabout to be completed
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,when the ceasefire was signed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, the time has come \Nfor this thing to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.58,0:04:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're at a disadvantage when \Nit comes to combat strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.71,0:04:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We absolutely must complete this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.97,0:04:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,To do that, we need the help of Tsai,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.01,0:04:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,the God Spear-Wielder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's deep in the mountains \Nof Ryube Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.60,0:04:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Would the three of you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.77,0:04:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,go see Tsai and deliver our request?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:43.95,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}RYUBE VILLAGE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.12,0:04:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.42,0:04:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.75,0:04:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.63,0:05:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Please eat this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.18,0:05:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.44,0:05:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Rikimaru, a wandering traveler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.48,0:05:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forget this kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.90,0:05:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad we were able to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.61,0:05:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Rikimaru! Make sure you eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.82,0:05:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be sure to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.75,0:05:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.71,0:05:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"Burn down every village \Nharboring traitors."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.17,0:05:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Lord Luca for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All for Highland's victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.18,0:05:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it this house?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.48,0:05:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Anyone home?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.61,0:06:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess no one's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.65,0:06:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mind if we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.82,0:06:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we be going inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.57,0:06:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.79,0:06:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.84,0:06:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you break into someone's home?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.26,0:06:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.39,0:06:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you Mr. Tsai, the God Spear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.89,0:06:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Tsai. Just Tsai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.90,0:06:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So you came all the way to \Nthis remote mountain area
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,at the request of Viktor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.98,0:06:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting a war on such false \Npretexts is utterly absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.70,0:06:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.16,0:06:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, let's leave as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.50,0:06:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! Ryube Village is on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.39,0:07:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.02,0:07:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me return to Toto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Toto was burned to the ground
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.61,0:07:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,for harboring that traitorous brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.03,0:07:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.86,0:07:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't kill me. I'll do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.54,0:07:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, pretend you're a pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.91,0:07:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard him! Act like a pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.59,0:07:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.10,0:08:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.36,0:08:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.99,0:08:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's out of his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.08,0:08:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We still need more blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.62,0:08:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn everything to the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.92,0:08:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no trace of the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.13,0:08:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.93,0:08:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's split up and search for survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.85,0:08:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Rikimaru, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.90,0:08:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe what \Nthe Highland Army did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.49,0:08:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Such cruelty!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.91,0:08:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably not just this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear they also burned \Ndown Toto Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.96,0:09:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Toto?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.33,0:09:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard they were harboring a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.34,0:09:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.76,0:09:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Jowy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.09,0:09:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Those people saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.01,0:09:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go to Toto!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.01,0:09:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.10,0:09:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.23,0:09:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you two always leave me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.11,0:09:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Nanami.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.11,0:09:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.32,0:09:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But someone has to take \NMr. Tsai to the fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.32,0:09:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.66,0:09:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I know where the fortress is,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.21,0:09:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,so we'll go ahead on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.17,0:09:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.17,0:09:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me join them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.13,0:09:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can offer some extra muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, please go with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.97,0:09:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry over to Toto Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.48,0:10:05.40,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}TOTO VILLAGE
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.86,0:10:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.33,0:10:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Pilika?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.41,0:10:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Pilika!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.25,0:10:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.17,0:10:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.72,0:10:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy told me to go hide in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.97,0:10:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So I hid in the shrine, \Nlike I was supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.19,0:10:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, I heard a really scary sound,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.86,0:10:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,so I came out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.32,0:10:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Our house was on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.62,0:11:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy and Daddy were caught in the fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and now they won't wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.83,0:11:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy and Daddy are dead, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.13,0:11:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise to be a good girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.81,0:11:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry I couldn't keep my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.98,0:11:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.98,0:11:34.90,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}AGARES BLIGHT
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.99,0:11:37.91,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}LUCA BLIGHT
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.99,0:11:39.49,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}L'RENOUILLE CASTLE
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.57,0:11:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We received a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.12,0:11:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The soldiers we sent to Lord \NLuca's residence to conduct
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.45,0:11:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,a covert investigation have gone missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.46,0:11:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Luca, what has made you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.67,0:11:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I also believe in the path \Nto peace you are pursuing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.47,0:12:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Jillia, I appreciate that,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.51,0:12:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but if Luca finds out, he might \Nturn hostile on you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.31,0:12:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Be cautious with your actions and words.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.86,0:12:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.36,0:12:19.45,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}MERCENARY FORTRESS
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Must've been rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.37,0:12:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard from Tsai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.20,0:12:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Pilika.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.12,0:12:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The sole survivor of Toto Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.37,0:12:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you're here, you'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.46,0:12:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make sure you're protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.21,0:12:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You should get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.26,0:12:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.63,0:12:40.72,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}HIGHLAND ARMY CAMP
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.80,0:12:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Kiba, your thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.97,0:12:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,To take the fortress,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.56,0:12:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,we should split our forces and \Nadvance through the forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.73,0:12:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's heavily trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.90,0:12:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Given our numerical advantage,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.82,0:12:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,a direct frontal assault should suffice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's strike them head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.70,0:13:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And as usual, you will lead the charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.54,0:13:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Solon Jhee, you take the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.96,0:13:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.51,0:13:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pilika, is it okay \Nif I tell you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.43,0:13:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.06,0:13:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I also lost someone who was \Nreally important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.94,0:13:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.60,0:13:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, an old man named Genkaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.48,0:13:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He died, and suddenly he \Nwasn’t there anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.57,0:13:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you, I was so sad,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.45,0:13:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and I cried every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.58,0:13:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.41,0:13:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know, I'm not lonely anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.62,0:13:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.84,0:13:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I close my eyes and think to myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.21,0:14:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"Grandpa Genkaku, please come out!"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.34,0:14:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,"I want to see you!"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.13,0:14:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, he always comes to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.47,0:14:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I can even talk to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.81,0:14:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.18,0:14:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.10,0:14:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If you keep thinking about \Nthem in your heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.69,0:14:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you might be able to see \Nyour mom and dad, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.86,0:14:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.87,0:14:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.95,0:14:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't see him right away,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but now that I can, you can, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.25,0:14:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.30,0:14:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Riliu, I've decided to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,With the Highland Army? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.68,0:14:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you fight alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to fight alongside you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.27,0:14:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.90,0:15:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.23,0:15:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.49,0:15:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.86,0:15:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.53,0:15:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,According to our scouting unit,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.04,0:15:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the Highland Army is \Nabout to make its move!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.54,0:15:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We've requested reinforcements from Muse,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.63,0:15:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but legislative approval is taking \Ntime, so don't count on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.72,0:15:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally, given the difference \Nin troop numbers,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.51,0:15:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,we'd take a defensive stance,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.39,0:15:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,but against Luca Blight, that won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.90,0:15:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So we’re launching a preemptive \Nstrike with our secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.03,0:15:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dragon Spear
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.11,0:15:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,hurls flaming spears over the forest to \Nignite a wall of fire before our foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.24,0:15:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.28,0:15:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack them from the \Nforest on both sides!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.75,0:15:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If this fortress falls,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.50,0:16:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,all parts east of Muse will \Nfall under Highland control!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.76,0:16:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We must win this battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.47,0:16:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.30,0:16:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, swear by this lion flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.18,0:16:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll defend this fort to the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.15,0:16:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A lion flag?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.98,0:16:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was a bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.82,0:16:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a report!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.53,0:16:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The Highland Army has begun its advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.16,0:16:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, take your positions!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.42,0:16:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.67,0:16:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy is coming straight \Nat us as expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.80,0:16:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the Dragon Spear ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready anytime!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.47,0:16:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The wind's fine.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.73,0:16:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The angle's good.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.73,0:17:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everything's as planned.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.60,0:17:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.41,0:17:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What the devil? Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.16,0:17:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.54,0:17:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The wind pushed it slightly off target!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.25,0:17:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Second spear, reload quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.29,0:17:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Three degrees east.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.54,0:17:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.38,0:17:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.01,0:17:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How do they have a weapon like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.60,0:17:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Your invasion stops here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.97,0:17:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill all the rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.27,0:17:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange. I don't \Nsee Luca anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.07,0:17:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he taking the trap-filled forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.50,0:18:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Flik! Luca's in the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.80,0:18:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is as far as you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.56,0:18:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Thunder Flik! You're \Nnot going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.11,0:18:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.32,0:18:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.95,0:18:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kobold!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.33,0:18:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Out for a walk with your owner?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.25,0:18:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mess with Gengen, and \Nyou're gonna get hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.08,0:18:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Luca will be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.25,0:18:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Please secure the necessary \Nsupplies in case of evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.76,0:18:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,On it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.38,0:18:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.22,0:18:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's position the Dragon Spear in \Nfront to strengthen our defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.81,0:19:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.85,0:19:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Access to this fortress \Nis from the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.23,0:19:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,When they come up the hill,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.94,0:19:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll unleash the Dragon Spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.11,0:19:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.07,0:19:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.44,0:19:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Luca's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.24,0:19:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.95,0:19:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.16,0:19:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.33,0:19:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.46,0:19:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't use the Flame Spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.59,0:19:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an act of sabotage \Nby the Highland Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.43,0:19:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And Luca Blight is almost here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.76,0:19:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Pohl!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.27,0:19:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The gate is opening!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.52,0:19:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.03,0:19:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sabotage from within.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.78,0:19:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I underestimated the situation.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.99,0:20:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Slaughter every last one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.84,0:20:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.55,0:20:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Pilika!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.30,0:20:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.10,0:20:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.68,0:20:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.94,0:20:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Pilika!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.52,0:20:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.82,0:20:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are. I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.99,0:20:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.24,0:20:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.16,0:20:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanami!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Pilika and Pohl are in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.33,0:20:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,along with the Highland Army's commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.59,0:20:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's Luca. -We have to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.30,0:21:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Pilika!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.55,0:21:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let Pilika go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.73,0:21:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,City-State pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.07,0:21:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Help…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.46,0:21:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.55,0:21:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from Pilika!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.10,0:21:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.89,0:21:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The strong take everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.52,0:21:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,while death is all that awaits the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.03,0:22:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.28,0:22:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.82,0:22:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.28,0:22:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, that look!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.62,0:22:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The look of suffering and helplessness!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.37,0:22:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.55,0:22:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Leading to tomorrow{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.81,0:22:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And burning with passion{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.56,0:22:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The door to the night{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.03,0:22:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Blazes red{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.33,0:22:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Time after time{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.67,0:23:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No matter{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.55,0:23:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How long it takes{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.26,0:23:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will get it{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.85,0:23:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}While I am alive here{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.27,0:23:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Holding so tight{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.82,0:23:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With all my heart{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.45,0:23:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To the sun's warmth{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.66,0:23:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Behind my eyes{\i0}

